---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = false;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan"
  description="Privacy Policy for Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan. Learn how we collect, use, protect, and manage personal information shared through our website, ads, WhatsApp, and other communications."
  ogType="website"
  jsonLd={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Privacy Policy",
    "description": "Privacy policy for Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "EducationalOrganization",
      "name": "Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan"
    }
  }}
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 via-white to-slate-50 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/5 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-secondary">
        Legal Information
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-medium text-slate-600 md:text-lg">Effective date: October 17, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-premium md:p-10">
        <p class="text-base leading-8 text-slate-700">
          Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan ("Margdarshak", "we", "us", or "our") operates a WhatsApp-based messaging platform that enables businesses to communicate with their customers through the WhatsApp Business Platform (Cloud API). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you use our services.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your name, business name, phone number, and email address when you sign up for our platform.</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp Business Data:</strong> WhatsApp Business Account (WABA) details, phone number IDs, and message template information when you connect your WhatsApp account through our platform.</li>
            <li><strong>Message Data:</strong> Content of messages sent and received through our platform, including text, media, and delivery status.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Phone numbers and names of contacts you communicate with through our services.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about how you interact with our platform, including login times, features used, and message volumes.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Browser type, IP address, device information, and operating system collected automatically when you access our platform.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700">
            <li>To provide and maintain our WhatsApp messaging services.</li>
            <li>To send and receive messages on your behalf through the WhatsApp Business Platform.</li>
            <li>To manage your WhatsApp Business Account, message templates, and campaigns.</li>
            <li>To provide customer support and respond to your inquiries.</li>
            <li>To monitor and improve the performance and reliability of our platform.</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations and Meta's platform policies.</li>
            <li>To send you service-related notifications and updates.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">3. Data Sharing</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We do not sell your personal information. We may share your data only in the following circumstances:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>Meta / WhatsApp:</strong> Message data is transmitted through Meta's WhatsApp Business Platform (Cloud API) as required to deliver the messaging service. Meta's own data practices are governed by their privacy policy.</li>
            <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We may use third-party services for hosting, analytics, or infrastructure that process data on our behalf under strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law, court order, or government regulation.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. These measures include encrypted data transmission, secure server infrastructure, and access controls. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">5. Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We retain your data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide our services. Message data is retained for a reasonable period necessary for service delivery and compliance. When you request account or data deletion, we will remove your data within 30 days, except where retention is required by law.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">6. Your Rights and Data Deletion</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">You have the following rights regarding your data:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
            <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
            <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request deletion of your personal data at any time.</li>
            <li><strong>Portability:</strong> You can request your data in a portable format.</li>
            <li><strong>Withdrawal of Consent:</strong> You can withdraw consent for data processing at any time.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-slate-700">To exercise any of these rights, including requesting deletion of your data, please contact us using the details provided below. We will respond to your request within 30 days.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">7. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">Our platform may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that we have collected data from a minor, we will take steps to delete it promptly.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, wish to exercise your data rights, or want to request deletion of your data, please contact us:</p>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <p><strong>Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan</strong></p>
            <p>Email: <a class="text-secondary underline" href="mailto:margdarshakss@gmail.com">margdarshakss@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
